LAMBDA:
Search for Lambda->Create function->Author from scratch->Function
name:my-lambda-s3-function->Runtime:Python 3.11->Create function

Code: Remove the existing code and copy and paste the code from the next
slide->Deploy

Configuration->Permissions->Click on the Execution role name link->Add
permissions->Attach policies->Search for S3->Select AmazonS3FullAccess
->Add permission

Go to Lambda->Triggers->Add Trigger->Select a source: S3->Bucket:Select
your bucket->Leave everything else as default->Acknowledge->Add

In S3, Click on the Bucket name->Properties->Scroll down->Event
notifications will show our Lambda event

